  "body": "**Professionals Real Estate looks forward to welcoming you home.**\r\n\r\nDiscover the perfect blend of space, style, and modern family living in this brand new home in the highly sought-after Ara Hills community. Thoughtfully designed to accommodate growing families and multi-generational living, this impressive home offers generous proportions, versatile living spaces, and all the benefits of a newly completed home.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, you'll appreciate the sense of space and functionality throughout. Designed with contemporary living in mind, the heart of the home features a stunning open-plan kitchen, dining and living area that seamlessly connects to the outdoor entertaining spaces. With multiple living zones and six bedrooms, there is room for everyone to enjoy their own space while still coming together as a family. \r\n\r\nFeaturing:\r\n* Six generous bedrooms \r\n* Three well-appointed bathrooms\r\n* Three living areas offering flexibility for families of all sizes \r\n* Modern open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area\r\n* Separate laundry for added convenience\r\n\r\n**Do you need to sell in order to purchase? There may be some flexibility with this listing - get in touch to discuss options.**\r\n\r\nBuilt to a high standard with modern finishes throughout, this home offers a fresh and contemporary feel while providing practical spaces for everyday living. Whether you're accommodating extended family, working from home, or simply seeking extra room for a growing household, this thoughtfully designed layout delivers exceptional versatility and comfort.\r\n\r\nLocated within the thriving Ara Hills community, you'll enjoy a fantastic lifestyle surrounded by quality homes, scenic walkways, and convenient access to local amenities. Just minutes from the vibrant Orewa, beautiful beaches, cafes, restaurants, shops, and excellent schools, this location offers the perfect balance of modern convenience and relaxed living. \r\n\r\nThis outstanding new build opportunity is ready and waiting for its first owners to move in and enjoy. Contact Sarah today for further information or to arrange your private viewing. Open Homes as advertised. \r\n\r\nOur Vendors are motivated to sell and we are open to offers. Don't delay, this must be sold! \r\n\r\nMore house and land packages are available in Ara Hills, Orewa from this Developer. If you are looking for something entry level, an investment or looking to buy off plan, get in touch with Sarah for more options. \r\n\r\n**Experienced. Trusted. Consistent. Local Professionals.**\r\n\r\n**We believe real estate should be done better. Higher standards, clear communication, and proven systems are the reason our clients trust us to deliver, time and time again.**",
